            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "### 2. Le passage à la chimie : Les coefficients",
            "start": 891,
            "end": 939
          },
          {
            "id": "p13",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "En chimie, les ingrédients sont les **réactifs**, et le plat final est le **produit**.",
            "start": 941,
            "end": 1027
          },
          {
            "id": "p14",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Prenons la fabrication de l'eau :",
            "start": 1029,
            "end": 1062
          },
          {
            "id": "p15",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "$$\\text{2 H}_2 + \\text{O}_2 \\rightarrow \\text{2 H}_2\\text{O}$$",
            "start": 1063,
            "end": 1125
          },
          {
            "id": "p16",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Regarde les grands chiffres devant les molécules (on les appelle les **coefficients stœchiométriques**) :",
            "start": 1127,
            "end": 1232
          },
          {
            "id": "p17",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* Le **2** devant $\\text{H}_2$",
            "start": 1233,
            "end": 1263
          },
          {
            "id": "p18",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* Le **1** sous-entendu devant $\\text{O}_2$",
            "start": 1264,
            "end": 1307
          },
          {
            "id": "p19",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* Le **2** devant $\\text{H}_2\\text{O}$",
            "start": 1308,
            "end": 1346
          },
          {
            "id": "p20",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "statement"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Cela se lit exactement comme la recette du sandwich : ",
            "start": 1348,
            "end": 1402
          },
          {
            "id": "p21",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "*\"Il me faut 2 molécules de dihydrogène et 1 molécule de dioxygène pour fabriquer 2 molécules d'eau.\"*",
            "start": 1403,
            "end": 1505
          },
          {
            "id": "p22",
            "category": "CONCEPT",
            "attributes": {
              "depth": "explanation"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "> **Règle d'or de Lavoisier :** *\"Rien ne se perd, rien ne se crée, tout se transforme.\"* Tu dois toujours avoir le même nombre d'atomes à gauche (réactifs) et à droite (produits). Ici, on a 4 hydrogènes et 2 oxygènes des deux côtés. L'équation est dite **équilibrée**.",
            "start": 1507,
            "end": 1776
          },
          {
            "id": "p23",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "separator"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "---",
            "start": 1778,
            "end": 1781
          }
        ],
        "accuracy": {
          "verdict": "accurate",
          "reason": "The equation 2 H2 + O2 -> 2 H2O is correctly balanced, the stoichiometric coefficients are accurately identified, and Lavoisier's conservation of atoms is properly stated.",
          "errors": []
        }
